WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.244
"Oh no!" cried the Ghost Bandit.

2
00:00:06.245 --> 00:00:08.568
He was covered in ink.

3
00:00:08.569 --> 00:00:11.130
Now Roxy could see the villain.

4
00:00:11.131 --> 00:00:13.047
He was tall and thin.

5
00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:15.319
He carried a large bag.

6
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.109
A round object was on his back.

7
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.443
"That's probably a battery for his suit," Roxy thought.

8
00:00:22.444 --> 00:00:25.744
"That's how he stays invisible."

9
00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:30.528
"You still won't catch me!" yelled the Ghost Bandit.

10
00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.020
He held up a small device.

11
00:00:33.021 --> 00:00:36.056
Shling! A claw shot out.

12
00:00:36.057 --> 00:00:38.101
It was attached to a cable.

13
00:00:38.102 --> 00:00:41.203
The claw hooked onto a windowsill high up.

14
00:00:41.204 --> 00:00:44.595
The Ghost Bandit pressed a button on the device.

15
00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:48.453
The cable quickly pulled the villain up to the windowsill.

16
00:00:48.454 --> 00:00:53.166
Roxy laughed. "You can't escape," she said.

17
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:56.733
"Police have the entire building surrounded."

18
00:00:56.734 --> 00:01:00.339
The Ghost Bandit looked down and saw all the police.

19
00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:03.836
Some news reporters had arrived too.

20
00:01:03.837 --> 00:01:09.909
"Ha!" cried the Ghost Bandit. "There's a fountain!"

21
00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:16.215
He fired the device again.

22
00:01:16.216 --> 00:01:18.761
Then he shot out the window.

23
00:01:18.762 --> 00:01:20.831
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

24
00:01:20.832 --> 00:01:24.279
She flew as fast as she could.

25
00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:28.477
Outside, she saw the Ghost Bandit zipping above the police.

26
00:01:28.478 --> 00:01:30.498
A police officer looked up.

27
00:01:30.499 --> 00:01:33.819
"There's the Ghost Bandit!" he cried.

28
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.943
The Ghost Bandit was soon above the fountain.

29
00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:39.255
Roxy watched the villain.

30
00:01:39.256 --> 00:01:44.002
"If he lands in that water, he'll be invisible again!" she thought. The

31
00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.935
Ghost Bandit dropped down. Roxy

32
00:01:46.936 --> 00:01:50.049
fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

33
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:54.588
The battery exploded. Splash!

34
00:01:54.589 --> 00:02:01.681
The Ghost Bandit leaped out of the fountain. "Ha-ha!"

35
00:02:01.682 --> 00:02:04.194
He laughed. "Now

36
00:02:04.195 --> 00:02:07.232
you'll never catch me! I'll—oh

37
00:02:07.233 --> 00:02:09.927
no!" The

38
00:02:09.928 --> 00:02:13.753
Ghost Bandit saw his reflection in a store window. "My

39
00:02:13.754 --> 00:02:19.786
suit—it's ruined!" Roxy's

40
00:02:19.787 --> 00:02:23.395
friends were still watching TV in Jack's house. The

41
00:02:23.396 --> 00:02:26.353
news reporter was talking to Roxy. The

42
00:02:26.354 --> 00:02:29.086
Ghost Bandit was in handcuffs. Police

43
00:02:29.087 --> 00:02:32.388
officers were taking money out of the bag. "Rocket

44
00:02:32.389 --> 00:02:35.264
Girl," said the reporter. "Is

45
00:02:35.265 --> 00:02:41.408
that the villain you were chasing earlier today?" Roxy

46
00:02:41.409 --> 00:02:45.255
smiled. "That's the Ghost Bandit. He

47
00:02:45.256 --> 00:02:46.849
was invisible. But

48
00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.595
I finally caught him!" "So

49
00:02:49.596 --> 00:02:53.704
Rocket Girl is a good guy, folks," said the reporter. "And

50
00:02:53.705 --> 00:02:57.645
thanks to her, Metro City is safe once again! Now

51
00:02:57.646 --> 00:03:02.117
back to Mighty Man ."

52
00:03:02.118 --> 00:03:05.933
"I knew Rocket Girl was innocent," said Terrell.

53
00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:08.013
Jack and Mara smiled.

54
00:03:08.014 --> 00:03:12.323
"I'm glad Rocket Girl isn't a bad guy," said Jack.

55
00:03:12.324 --> 00:03:14.251
Roxy walked into the room.

56
00:03:14.252 --> 00:03:16.749
She had a big smile.

57
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.497
"Hey, everybody! I'm back."

58
00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:22.805
Terrell looked at the TV and then at Roxy.

59
00:03:22.806 --> 00:03:25.303
"Are you feeling better?"

60
00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:27.946
Roxy flopped onto the sofa.

61
00:03:27.947 --> 00:03:33.961
"I feel great!"

